\"autóalkatrész,kompatibilitás,OE szám,alkatrészkereső,AutoFit AI\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-ink-950 font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"relative flex min-h-screen flex-col\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-radial-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 bg-grid bg-grid-fade opacity-[0.35]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-ink-950/40 backdrop-blur-sm\"><nav class=\"container-page flex h-16 items-center justify-between gap-4\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"AutoFit AI – főoldal\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-none\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\">AutoFit<span class=\"text-brand-500\"> AI</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-graphite-500\">Parts Compatibility</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 lg:flex\"><a class=\"link-nav link-nav-active\" href=\"/\">Főoldal</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\">Kompatibilitás</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/alkatreszek\">Alkatrészek</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/garazs\">Garázs</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/utitervek\">Útiterv</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 lg:flex\"><a class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-ink-600 text-graphite-300 transition-colors hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:text-white\" aria-label=\"Alkatrészkereső\" href=\"/alkatreszek\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"/bejelentkezes\">Bejelentkezés</a><a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"/regisztracio\">Regisztráció</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-ink-600 text-graphite-200 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menü\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"container-page relative grid items-center gap-12 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] lg:py-24\"><div class=\"animate-fade-up\"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-ink-700 bg-ink-850/70 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-graphite-300\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-pulse-ring rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span></span>Valós adatbázis · Supabase</div><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-white text-balance sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">Találd meg a járművedhez<span class=\"relative mx-2 inline-block\"><span class=\"relative z-10 text-brand-500\">pontosan illő</span></span>alkatrészt.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite-300 sm:text-lg\">Az AutoFit AI összeköti az autóadatokat az alkatrészadatokkal. Válaszd ki az autót, add meg az alkatrészt, és kapj azonnal érthető kompatibilitási eredményt – indoklással együtt.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"btn-primary px-6 py-3 text-base\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg>Kompatibilitás ellenőrzés</a><a class=\"btn-ghost px-6 py-3 text-base\" href=\"/alkatreszek\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg>Alkatrészek böngészése</a></div><dl class=\"mt-12 grid max-w-lg grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div><dt class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-white sm:text-xl\">PostgreSQL</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-graphite-400 sm:text-sm\">valós adatbázis</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-white sm:text-xl\">OE szám</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-graphite-400 sm:text-sm\">alapú egyeztetés</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold text-white sm:text-xl\">Supabase</dt><dd class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-graphite-400 sm:text-sm\">hitelesítés</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"animate-fade-up [animation-delay:120ms]\"><form class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-5 shadow-card sm:p-6\" aria-label=\"Gyors kompatibilitás kereső\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-brand-500/10 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-brand-500/15 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white\">Kompatibilitás gyorsellenőrzés</p><p class=\"text-xs text-graphite-400\">Válaszd ki a járműved, és nézd meg, mit tud a rendszer</p></div></div><div class=\"relative grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div><label class=\"label\">Márka</label><select class=\"input\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Válassz…</option></select></div><div><label class=\"label\">Modell</label><select class=\"input\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Előbb márka</option></select></div><div><label class=\"label\">Generáció</label><select class=\"input\" disabled=\"\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Előbb modell</option></select></div></div><div class=\"relative mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs text-graphite-500\">Tipp: a márka → modell → generáció sorrendben haladj.</p><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg>Teljes ellenőrzés indítása<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></form><div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-500/[0.07] px-4 py-3\" role=\"note\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-300\">i</span><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-emerald-100/90 sm:text-sm\">Az adatok és az eredmények a csatlakoztatott Supabase adatbázisból származnak.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container-page\"><div class=\"divider-glow\"></div></div></section><section class=\"container-page py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400\"><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span>Mit tud a rendszer</div><h2 class=\"section-title\">Egy platform, ami átláthatóvá teszi a kompatibilitást</h2><p class=\"section-sub\">Az AutoFit AI négy fő pillérre épül: gyors ellenőrzés, kereshető katalógus, személyes garázs és mentett eredmények.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"card card-hover group p-5\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-500/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Kompatibilitás ellenőrzés</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Autó és alkatrész megadása után azonnal látszik az illeszkedés – indoklással, részletesen.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover group p-5\" style=\"animation-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-500/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Alkatrészkereső</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Keresés név, OE szám vagy gyártói cikkszám alapján, kategória- és rendezési szűrőkkel.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover group p-5\" style=\"animation-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-500/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Autógarázs</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Mentsd el a járműveidet, és az ellenőrzéseknél egy kattintással előtöltheted őket.</p></div><div class=\"card card-hover group p-5\" style=\"animation-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-500/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Mentett ellenőrzések</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">A korábbi kompatibilitási eredmények és kedvenc alkatrészeid egy helyen, elérhetően.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container-page py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400\"><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span>Népszerű kategóriák</div><h2 class=\"section-title\">Böngéssz alkatrészkategóriák szerint</h2><p class=\"section-sub\">Válassz kategóriát, és a keresőben már csak az ide tartozó alkatrészeket látod.</p></div><a class=\"btn-ghost shrink-0\" href=\"/alkatreszek\">Összes alkatrész<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mt-10\"><p class=\"rounded-xl border border-dashed border-ink-600 bg-ink-900/40 px-4 py-6 text-sm text-graphite-400\">Nincs betöltött alkatrészkategória az adatbázisban.</p></div></section><section class=\"relative border-y border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/40 py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"container-page\"><div class=\"text-center mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400 justify-center\"><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span>Hogyan működik<span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span></div><h2 class=\"section-title\">Négy lépés a biztos döntésig</h2><p class=\"section-sub mx-auto\">A folyamat a jármű kiválasztásától a részletes eredményig vezet – végig átláthatóan.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-full top-8 hidden h-px w-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/50 to-transparent lg:block\"></div><div class=\"card h-full p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink-600\">01</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Válaszd ki az autót</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Márka, modell, generáció, évjárat, karosszéria és motorkód – pontosan, ahogy a valóságban.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-full top-8 hidden h-px w-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/50 to-transparent lg:block\"></div><div class=\"card h-full p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wrench h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink-600\">02</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Add meg az alkatrészt</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Név, OE szám, gyártói cikkszám, kategória. Képfeltöltéssel is megjelölheted a vizsgálandó alkatrészt.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-full top-8 hidden h-px w-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/50 to-transparent lg:block\"></div><div class=\"card h-full p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink-600\">03</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Futtasd az ellenőrzést</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">A rendszer kiértékeli az adatokat, és kompatibilis / nem kompatibilis / bizonytalan eredményt ad.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"card h-full p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink-600\">04</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Nézd meg a részleteket</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Részletes eredménykártya: jármű, alkatrész, státusz, indoklás és figyelmeztetések egy helyen.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container-page py-16 sm:py-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400\"><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span>Későbbi funkciók</div><h2 class=\"section-title\">Amit a következő fázisokban tervezünk</h2><p class=\"section-sub\">Ezek a funkciók egyelőre helyet kapnak a felületen, de még nem működnek. A cél a fokozatos, valós integráció.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-850/60 px-4 py-3.5\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scan-line h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 12h10\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-graphite-200\">AI alkatrész felismerés képből</span><span class=\"ml-auto rounded-full border border-ink-600 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-500\">soon</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-ink-700 bg-ink-850/60 px-4 py-3.5\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><