d h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-500/15 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-6 w-6\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-3xl\">Készítsd el a fiókod, és kezdd el a saját járműveiddel</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-300 sm:text-base\">Regisztrálj, mentsd el az autóidat a garázsba, és kövesd nyomon a kompatibilitási ellenőrzéseidet.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a class=\"btn-primary px-6 py-3\" href=\"/regisztracio\">Regisztráció</a><a class=\"btn-ghost px-6 py-3\" href=\"/bejelentkezes\">Bejelentkezés</a><a class=\"btn-outline px-6 py-3\" href=\"/admin\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Admin belépés</a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-20 border-t border-ink-800 bg-ink-950\"><div class=\"container-page py-14\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(3,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2.5\" aria-label=\"AutoFit AI – főoldal\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"relative grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-white\"><path d=\"M4 15.5 5.6 9.2A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 7.93 7.5h8.14a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 2.33 1.7L20 15.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.2 15.5h17.6v2.6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-.8H6.8v.8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><circle cx=\"7.4\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle><circle cx=\"16.6\" cy=\"13\" r=\"1.05\" fill=\"#fff\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-none\"><span class=\"font-display text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\">AutoFit<span class=\"text-brand-500\"> AI</span></span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-graphite-500\">Parts Compatibility</span></span></a><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Modern autóalkatrész-kompatibilitási platform. Találd meg a járművedhez illő alkatrészt – gyorsan, átláthatóan, megbízhatóan.</p><div class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-500/25 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-300\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-brand-400\"></span>Valós adatbázis · Supabase</div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\">Kompatibilitás ellenőrző</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-colors hover:text-brand-400\" href=\"/alkatreszek\">Alkatrészkereső</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-graphite-400 transition-color